.433104166666666}, {"text": "American.", "start": 13.433104166666666, "end": 13.653104166666665}]}, {"id": "b05", "text": "Then gas jumps everywhere because the USA pumps more oil than any other country.", "start": 14.509062499999999, "end": 18.2890625, "words": [{"text": "Then", "start": 14.509062499999999, "end": 14.789062499999998}, {"text": "gas", "start": 14.929062499999999, "end": 15.0690625}, {"text": "jumps", "start": 15.0690625, "end": 15.3290625}, {"text": "everywhere", "start": 15.3290625, "end": 15.7290625}, {"text": "because", "start": 15.7290625, "end": 16.1690625}, {"text": "the", "start": 16.1690625, "end": 16.3090625}, {"text": "USA", "start": 16.3090625, "end": 16.5090625}, {"text": "pumps", "start": 16.5090625, "end": 16.889062499999998}, {"text": "more", "start": 16.889062499999998, "end": 17.1490625}, {"text": "oil", "start": 17.1490625, "end": 17.389062499999998}, {"text": "than", "start": 17.389062499999998, "end": 17.6490625}, {"text": "any", "start": 17.6490625, "end": 17.8290625}, {"text": "other", "start": 17.8290625, "end": 18.0290625}, {"text": "country.", "start": 18.0290625, "end": 18.2890625}]}, {"id": "b06", "text": "So countries lose savings because over half the money they save is American dollars.", "start": 18.9540625, "end": 22.7140625, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 18.9540625, "end": 19.174062499999998}, {"text": "countries", "start": 19.374062499999997, "end": 19.5740625}, {"text": "lose", "start": 19.5740625, "end": 19.834062499999998}, {"text": "savings", "start": 19.834062499999998, "end": 20.1340625}, {"text": "because", "start": 20.1340625, "end": 20.4940625}, {"text": "over", "start": 20.4940625, "end": 20.7740625}, {"text": "half", "start": 20.7740625, "end": 21.014062499999998}, {"text": "the", "start": 21.014062499999998, "end": 21.194062499999998}, {"text": "money", "start": 21.194062499999998, "end": 21.354062499999998}, {"text": "they", "start": 21.354062499999998, "end": 21.514062499999998}, {"text": "save", "